/*
## The guide

The mode switch, the chapter rail, and a chapter page. The doc app is two
tabs over one model: a narrative GUIDE and the REFERENCE (the language forms,
then the classes). `app.mode` picks which; each keeps its own selection
(`app.chapter` / `app.selected` / `app.form`) so switching back lands where you
left. Both rails are folds: a group opens when it holds the current page.

Nav chrome does not ride `app.fontScale`: the A-stepper is a reading-comfort
control for the content pane; the rail keeps its designed sizes.
*/

// one chapter link in the guide rail — lights when it is the current chapter

class ChapterTab extends View [ width = 100%, height = 32, cornerRadius = 6,
